        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_7",
        on: "branch_if_7",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "malin_used_necromancy",
            equals: "yes",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Drogan",
            text: _("I hoped I’d never see ya again, Malin. You’re obviously not taking yer banishment seriously, so I’ll tell ya one last time — no matter why you’ve come back, we’re not welcomin’ ya here. Take one step closer to Parthyn and I’ll order tha guards to attack ya."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malin Keshar",
            text: _("Banishment or not, I’m here to help defend my home against the orcs!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Drogan",
            text: _("Orcs or not, ya gots ta leave!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malin Keshar",
            text: _("Dela, help me! You, at least, must see reason!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Drogan",
            text: _("Ya know there’s no way she’s sidin’ with ya."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dela Keshar",
            text: _("That... I don’t really..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Drogan",
            text: _("See? If ya keep bein’ stubborn, we’ll attack ya. Leave."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "advisor",
            text: _("Master, do not listen to them! He, too, has a choice, but he foolishly chooses to spurn your aid! He jeopardizes the safety of Parthyn!"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_8",
        on: "branch_if_8",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "malin_used_necromancy",
            not_equals: "yes",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Drogan",
            text: _("I didn’t think I’d ever see ya again, Malin. But what’s this awful thing that stands ’side ya?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malin Keshar",
            text: _("It is of little concern to you. It is merely the byproduct of the new magical arts that I have learned."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Drogan",
            text: _("It don’t take a trained mage ta see that yer ‘magical arts’ refers to necromancy! That creature stinks o’ death!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malin Keshar",
            text: _("And why should you care about such things? Orcs march on Parthyn! We must defend the town!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Drogan",
            text: _("Better ta face them orcs alone than ta use dark magic! I warned ya about this before, but obviously ya ignored me. Yer father’d be turnin’ in his grave if he be seein’ what you’ve become."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malin Keshar",
            text: _("You dare bring my father into this! I’ve fought with every fiber of my being against these orcs, and I’ve done it all to protect my country and kinsmen. Is this how you repay me? With scorn and disdain?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "advisor",
            text: _("Master, do not listen to him! He is clearly blinded by his own prejudice! He jeopardizes the safety of Parthyn!"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_6",
        on: "start",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malin Keshar",
            text: _("I bring word from the north, Drogan! Orcs march on Parthyn, no more than a few hours’ journey away. They mean to raid the village tonight!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_7",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_8",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malin Keshar",
            text: _("Silence from you."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malin Keshar",
            text: _("Drogan! With my newfound powers, I have already eliminated several orcish chieftains! If you will allow me to help, I will crush the one who comes here as well!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Drogan",
            text: _("Fine story ye be tellin’ me. I find it likelier that ya brought yer pet orcs here ta help ya take revenge on us. If I let ya through, yer undead will kill us where we stand ’n sack the whole city. Watchin’ ya grow up, I never could’ve thought you’d turn into such a traitor."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malin Keshar",
            text: _("And what of the rest of you? Dela, at least you don’t believe that, do you?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dela Keshar",
            text: _("I..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Drogan",
            text: _("Stop lookin’ ta her, Malin. Tha fact that even Dela be rejectin’ ya should tell ya how much o’ a traitor ye are."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "advisor",
            text: _("Master, he threatens the safety of the city by standing in your way."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malin Keshar",
            text: _("You’re the traitor, Drogan! This is twice now that you’ve tried to prevent me from protecting Parthyn. I’ll defend my home no matter the cost, even if it means I must cut you down first."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malin Keshar",
            text: _("<i>If I want the people of Parthyn to accept me back, I must be cautious. I musn’t kill any of them besides Drogan or they’ll oust me for good.</i>"),
          },
        ],
      },
