      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_22",
        on: "moveto",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter",
            x: "$loc.x",
            y: "$loc.y",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 400,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:remove_item",
            x: "$loc.x",
            y: "$loc.y",
            item_name: "",
            image: "",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "DroganGhoul",
            text: _("Grahhhuralug..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malin Keshar",
            text: _("As ugly in death as he was in life. Darken Volk was right. It <i>is</i> fitting."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dela Keshar",
            text: _("What have you done?! Killing Drogan wasn’t enough — ya had ta defile his body as well? How could ya turn him into such a... a hideous thing? I can’t believe how depraved you’ve become!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malin Keshar",
            text: _("What you see on the outside reflects the inside. The face of truth is undoubtedly an ugly one."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_achievement",
            id: "did_drogan",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_19",
        on: "die",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_dead_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Drogan%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:remove_item",
            x: 14,
            y: 9,
            item_name: "",
            image: "",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:play_music",
            file: "the_dangerous_symphony.ogg",
            play_once: "yes",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malin Keshar",
            text: _("See what your traitorous ways have won you, Drogan?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dela Keshar",
            text: _("Drogan, no! Malin, you monster, how could ya just murder Drogan in cold blood?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malin Keshar",
            text: _("He chose this fate for himself! I merely retaliated in turn!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dela Keshar",
            text: _("How could ye possibly think Drogan was tha traitor when you’re the one attacking Parthyn?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malin Keshar",
            text: _("What? I have not harmed even a single villager or guardsman besides Drogan! I am only trying to help, but none of you will listen to reason!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dela Keshar",
            text: _("I tried to! I wanted ta believe in ya, I really did. After Father died, you and Drogan were all I had..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malin Keshar",
            text: _("Then why did you listen to him instead of me? I was trying to keep us together. He was trying to tear us apart! You wouldn’t even lift a finger to help me when he threatened to attack me!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dela Keshar",
            text: _("Malin, that’s—"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malin Keshar",
            text: _("You’ve always been like this. You never think for yourself. You always just follow whatever other people tell you. Not a single original thought in your head."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dela Keshar",
            text: _("Malin—"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malin Keshar",
            text: _("That man used necromancy? He must be evil! Never mind that he be your own brother, trying to protect his own home!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_unit",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            kill: "yes",
            id: "Dela Keshar",
          },
          {
            tag: "foreach",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            item: "this_item",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
                variable: "this_item.profile",
                value: "portraits/dela-mad.webp",
                mode: "value",
              },
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:unstore_unit",
                variable: "this_item",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dela Keshar",
            text: _("Enough! There’s nothing I can say ta someone who embraces evil so shamelessly! You’ll pay for Drogan’s death!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malin Keshar",
            text: _("..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malin Keshar",
            text: _("<i>So, no matter what, she’ll be against me? Then this is hopeless. Even if they intend to fight me, I’ve no wish to fight the townsfolk...</i>"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malin Keshar",
            text: _("<i>I guess I should just leave and find Darken Volk.</i>"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scroll_to",
            x: 15,
            y: 0,
          },
