            unit: "u_7",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "OWarlord",
            text: _("Look what we have here! A human city on the verge of collapse and a necromancer with only a few paltry minions at his command. The wolves will feed well tonight!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malin Keshar",
            text: _("More orcs, and powerful ones at that! There’s no way I’m escaping now..."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_24",
        on: "victory",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malin Keshar",
            text: _("O gods, how did it come to this? My own sister determined to personally see to my demise. Banished from Parthyn, my country, my home... spurned by my people, whom I have given everything for... nothing has gone right ever since I got into an argument with that fat, orc-loving toad Zephrin and tried to curse him. I was only testing my new spell on him! It was only supposed to be a simple curse! How was I supposed to know it would kill him? Blasted Academy."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malin Keshar",
            text: _("... Now the only being who still wants to see me alive is a necromancer. I’m beginning to think that I’m the one who was cursed..."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_25",
        on: "last_breath",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
